1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~prohel/names/misc/weiss1.html#ud
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000141140984835
2 CONT
2 CONT There are no records showing that Jacob Grossman born 1826 in Police Moravia son of Markus Grossmann was Jacob Grossmann husband of Wilhelmine aka Mina Weiss born 1831 in Police Moravia, but we know that Mina was married to Jacob 
2 CONC Grossman from Police and that the first wife of Mina Weiss´s father Nathan Weiss Susanna nee Grossmann was a sister of Markus Grossmann the father of Jacob Grossmann. Jacob Grossman born 1826 fits also to a wife Mina Weiss born 18
2 CONC 31. Thomas Fürth
2 CONT
2 CONT However a death notice in Znaimer Wochenblatt 3 July 1901 tells us that Jacob Grossmann died 28 July 1901 75 years old of weakness (Erschöpnung der Kräfte), Znaimer Wochenblatt 3.7.1901 page 8https://anno.onb.ac.at/cgi-content/ann
2 CONC o?aid=zwb&datum=19010703&query=%22Grossmann%22&ref=anno-search&seite=8
