1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Updated from [http://www.myheritage.com/research/collection-1/myheritage-family-trees?itemId=116254071-19-5646&action=showRecord&indId=externalindividual-ee3a67fcafca63054d3ce86882fbcb80&mrid=1799411978a5c58e772a
2 CONC 4f8b334ffe6f MyHeritage Family Trees] via daughter [http://www.geni.com/profile-34679111437 Anna Catharina Esselius (born Hellberg)] by [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Oct 15 2015, 13:25:43 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT It has been suggested that Beata Christiernin was King Fredrik I's mistress after Hedvig Taube died and before Ebba Horn was appointed official 'maitresse'. According to Wikipedia this is mentioned in a 1959 book on Fredrik I by W
2 CONC alfrid Holst. Is there any other confirmation of this? How Beata then became wife of a country priest - though a well-connected one - and my 4 x great grandmother must be an interesting story...
2 CONT Details of the affair are to be found in the memoirs of Amiral Carl Tersmeden (also a cousin), who was ashamed of his part in 'procuring' Beata for the king.
2 CONT
