0 @N6000000002577303089@ NOTE !SOURCES:
1 CONT 1- The Records of A R Anderson, Syracuse, Davis, Utah.
1 CONT 2- Sep 1993: The records of Owen B Anderson, Pleasant Grove, Utah.
1 CONT 3- Swedish Postal Address Book.
1 CONT 4- 6 December 1995: An edit of the Ancestral File update.
1 CONT
1 CONT !NOTES:
1 CONT 1- This spouse was picked up from Owen B Anderson records. No
1 CONT explainations.
1 CONT 2- The birth and death place names for this person are listed on the
1 CONT recognized list for parish and county.
1 CONT 3- Sep 1993: A print out of the Ancestral File has the birth dates
1 CONT more clear, but does not have the ordinance dates nor children listed.
1 CONT 4- Oct 1994: The postal book has the birth locality listed as such
1 CONT for this person.
1 CONT 5- December 1995: This update of the Ancestral File has the death
1 CONT locality as "Aby", Sweden and the Birth place as "Aneby", Sweden. These       names are not listed in my parish listing. From the the address book I        feel that the names should be spelled "Asby" which will put the locality  
1 CONC     in Ostergotland County.
1 CONT I will still use the localities as we found them in dad's records.
1 CONT 6- There is still no listing of children for this marriage in the
1 CONT Ancesrtal File.
0 @N6000000002577166828@ NOTE !SOURCES:
1 CONT 1- The Records of A R Anderson, family genealogist, Syracuse Davis, Ut.
1 CONT 2- Sep 1993: The records of Owen B Anderson, brother, Pleasant Grove, Utah.
1 CONT 3- Swedish Postal Address Book.
1 CONT
1 CONT !NOTES:
1 CONT 1- I have found out that the name SMALAND is the name of a province
1 CONT in the center portion of Sweden which comprises the counties of Kalmar,
1 CONT Jonkoping, and Kronoberg. Askeryds is a parish in Jonkoping county.
1 CONT 2- Sep 1993: A print out of the Ancestral File has the birth dates more          clear, but does not have the ordinsnce dates nor children listed.
0 @N6000000002577169336@ NOTE !SOURCES:
1 CONT 1- A R Anderson Family records.
1 CONT 2- 25 Aug 1993: Owen B Anderson Family Records
1 CONT 3- 5 Oct 2000: Ancestral File report.
1 CONT
1 CONT !NOTES:
1 CONT 1- I have found out that the name SMALAND is the name of a province
1 CONT in the center portion of Sweden which comprises the counties of Kalmar,
1 CONT Jonkoping, and Kronoberg.
1 CONT 2- Askeryd is a parish in Jonkoping county.
1 CONT 3- Eleanor Wrangel is a cousin to Jons Adolph Meurling.
1 CONT 4- The Ancestral File has the given name of Jons as Jona.
